      <title>No. 4 Mississippi State Pulls Away from Baseball to Start Series</title>
      <link>https://lipscombsports.com/news/2026/3/5/no-4-mississippi-state-pulls-away-from-baseball-to-start-series.aspx</link>
      <description>STARKVILLE, Miss. – It was a tale of two baseball games on Thursday night, as the Lipscomb University Baseball team had a 1-0 lead through five and a half innings and held No. 4 Mississippi State University to three hits, but that all changed in the bottom of the sixth, as the Bulldogs scored five unanswered runs as they defeated the Bisons, 8-3, Thursday evening from Dudy Noble Field.</description>
